'''Doremi ''' (ドレミちゃん, '''''Doremi-chan''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Bakoo]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Baby Fake (Merciless)|First Errand]]. She was added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Doremi
|image = E 514.png
|appearance = [[Baby Fake (Merciless)|First Errand]]<br>
[[NEO First Errand]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Doremi has extreme attack power, 100% slow, very high health and a high knockback count as well as slow immunity. Like [[Bakoo]], she has a very low standing range, but also a massive Long Distance area and fast movement speed, so make sure to deploy everything before she strikes!

Hard-hitting units, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]], can outrange Doremi and constantly interrupt her attacks, making them valuable in the fights against her.

